* text=auto eol=lf
*.{cmd,[cC][mM][dD]} text eol=crlf
*.{bat,[bB][aA][tT]} text eol=crlf
# KiCad and FreeCAD emit AP214 STEP continuation records with trailing spaces.
# They are tool-generated CAD syntax, not source whitespace defects.
*.step -whitespace
*.cpp linguist-language=C++
*.h linguist-language=C++
*.ino linguist-language=C++
docs/** linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-detectable
